{"lines":[{"w":0.069448528289794975,"h":0.019149851014849339,"c":1,"t":"Reading","x":0.84342795741818799,"y":0.049797529637499394},{"w":0.70946975708007809,"h":0.020268904069989935,"c":1,"t":"journal that publishes peer reviews publicly alongside the paper. My views on the H. naledi","x":0.18851704205349526,"y":0.098734679016358795},{"t":"controversy are complicated. I do think more evidence is needed: in particular with regard","w":0.70079945882161465,"y":0.11694612459764564,"c":1,"h":0.020164545805325784,"x":0.19026300224867507},{"t":"to the dating of the etchings. At the same time, I think the specieẾmall brains are a","y":0.13425511300176662,"w":0.65764221191406247,"h":0.022700107539759595,"c":1,"x":0.1902122725439572},{"x":0.1919703451383839,"y":0.15302871668798901,"w":0.7025808715820312,"h":0.021038228936592462,"t":"distraction. Palaeoanthropologists got fixated on brain size because it was what they could","c":1},{"t":"see: if what you have is skeletons, then all you know about brains are their shapes and sizes.","w":0.7059907531738282,"y":0.17256009705852327,"x":0.19198506040363686,"h":0.0200103935951782,"c":1},{"w":0.69044896443684878,"h":0.022169840594452483,"t":"But other properties, such as the brain's internal wiring, are surely equally important and","y":0.1885686466854305,"c":1,"x":0.1919752202243464},{"x":0.19198945715928006,"w":0.69212036132812493,"y":0.20918277452482592,"h":0.019440279213843281,"c":1,"t":"may explain how a species like H. naledi might have been capable of complex behaviours,"},{"h":0.017561883172261483,"c":1,"y":0.22953114035445055,"t":"despite their small brains.","x":0.19204152532236696,"w":0.19896193186442057},{"h":0.023796441923746192,"c":1,"t":"In a sense, we shouldn't be surprised that so many of these behaviours had their origins","y":0.26172099539185645,"w":0.67845652262369793,"x":0.19190968882818973},{"t":"in older, extinct hominins. Evolution usually works by incremental steps and so does","x":0.1902401669305247,"w":0.65757792154947914,"h":0.021156168884960747,"c":1,"y":0.28116335640668655},{"c":1,"w":0.70242212931315096,"h":0.018931965464224265,"x":0.1903114266503986,"t":"technology. The first birds weren't great at flying, and the first mobile phones weren't great","y":0.30087209305022411},{"y":0.3161340220357709,"t":"at, well, anything really. The idea that there was a sudden explosion of intelligence and","c":1,"w":0.67325856526692707,"h":0.02413834717992791,"x":0.1901980321850211},{"c":1,"t":"creativity at some point in our evolution isn't inherently ridiculous: sometimes a system hits","h":0.019462195704081697,"y":0.33710112005148085,"x":0.19025851779567612,"w":0.71291005452473954},{"h":0.019828498738891587,"y":0.35589408577525861,"c":1,"x":0.19199246537652082,"w":0.71636276245117203,"t":"a tipping point and undergoes runaway change. But there was never that much evidence that"},{"c":1,"w":0.69723185221354156,"t":"human evolution worked this way. Instead, it seems the Neanderthals and many others all","x":0.19204151339707257,"y":0.37499999971478215,"h":0.017582225332400281},{"y":0.39534883696626233,"x":0.19204152151755774,"h":0.014534884186538477,"c":1,"t":"walked so we could run.","w":0.19204152425130208},{"h":0.020303819628342379,"y":0.42941304245397593,"c":1,"t":"One way or another, the H. naledi story is going to be an example of letting our","w":0.61778310139973969,"x":0.19198053132504772},{"x":0.19197151244794403,"y":0.44694531424510953,"w":0.69908325195312493,"t":"preconceptions get in the way of the evidence. The same is true for our ideas about gender","h":0.019996272007679949,"c":1},{"h":0.019055039503926396,"t":"in prehistory. Archaeology was invented by individuals with now unfashionably patriarchal","y":0.46641007674178714,"c":1,"x":0.19031142405446899,"w":0.70934254964192722},{"t":"views about gender, and those notions fed into their research. Today's researchers are trying","x":0.19198323823310573,"w":0.7111796569824218,"y":0.4824855223552651,"c":1,"h":0.020830215817151831},{"t":"to unpick this stuff, and there have been some significant steps in recent years.","x":0.19019214182625072,"y":0.49977581276961536,"h":0.024574092921049506,"c":1,"w":0.60574010213216156},{"t":"Perhaps the most dramatic was the demolition of 'Man the Hunter.This was the idea,","w":0.67654505411783861,"h":0.019731605695293419,"c":1,"y":0.53853781540442691,"x":0.19199609117491681},{"y":0.55366734107902194,"t":"promoted for decades, that in most prehistoric societies the men went out to hunt and the","x":0.19183757393217499,"w":0.69412282307942719,"h":0.024992284114082164,"c":1},{"w":0.6956683349609375,"h":0.020938675748959801,"t":"women looked after the home. However, a meta-analysis published in June 2023 compiled","x":0.19196851794895167,"y":0.57485470387185622,"c":1},{"y":0.594471658525489,"x":0.19204151981907158,"t":"data on several dozen foraging societies and found women hunted in 80 per cent of them. In","h":0.017494751574527623,"c":1,"w":0.71453287760416673},{"w":0.71117970784505202,"t":"line with this, it emerged that an ancient spear-throwing tool called an atlatl enables women","x":0.19026720891144142,"y":0.61228980653873799,"h":0.020367130522464305,"c":1},{"t":"to launch projectiles at the same speed as men. We have also seen growing evidence of","y":0.63044799116275063,"x":0.19198008652541687,"h":0.019533145335940194,"w":0.66621866861979162,"c":1},{"y":0.64970930235348323,"w":0.70242212931315107,"x":0.19204153042096303,"h":0.018940102728702835,"t":"women occupying positions of authority in ancient societies. The Viking queen Thyra may","c":1},{"w":0.70953343709309902,"x":0.19195066847379696,"h":0.021999125550725918,"t":"have helped unify Denmark in the 900s. Going further back, an Iberian leader from around","c":1,"y":0.66628083247187442},{"y":0.68588791999704868,"h":0.021103935695512055,"c":1,"x":0.19197822652881988,"w":0.69044784545898441,"t":"4000 years ago turned out to be female, not male as many had assumed, when proteins in"},{"w":0.19056529998779298,"c":1,"h":0.018865287679321052,"y":0.70626655458058996,"t":"her teeth were analysed.","x":0.19190431657051088},{"y":0.74115143648518722,"w":0.65410537719726558,"h":0.019722270498415906,"x":0.19197987404561465,"t":"It seems that the more we find out about past societies, the more our preconceptions","c":1},{"w":0.68858128865559898,"h":0.019043850348160918,"c":1,"x":0.19204153407473798,"t":"about the ways society 'has to be' turn out to be wrong. Inequality, authoritarianism and","y":0.75857242853310469},{"c":1,"w":0.68339101155598969,"y":0.77746676026418338,"t":"patriarchy aren't inevitable. They're choices, and prehistory shows us that we can choose","x":0.19204151223238597,"h":0.019044867422799316},{"w":0.087750199635823561,"h":0.018886058959533769,"c":1,"y":0.79698296732540541,"t":"differently.","x":0.19146600251395882},{"x":0.8892733567703256,"y":0.95203488379058654,"c":1,"t":"69","h":0.013081395100512871,"w":0.022491348584493087}],"w":2400,"h":2857}